### Connect to host when host is sending connections
``` 
socat -d -d -v TCP-LISTEN:101,reuseaddr,fork STDOUT
```

Check what webserver running 
# List service scripts in the default location
ls -l /etc/init.d/

# Find likely web server scripts
ls /etc/init.d | grep -Ei 'nginx|apache|httpd|lighttpd|caddy|haproxy'


